=== REASONING ===
- Widget uses two data sources: useLocations (ranked list) and useLocationSnapshotLatest (current badge)
- Standard (2×4): current location badge (Home/Work/Favorite/Other) + top 5 places via WidgetRankedList
- Compact (1×2): badge only with emoji + label
- WidgetRankedList handles sorting, limiting, empty state, bars, touch targets
- Map Location.visitCount → RankedItem.value, addressName → label, formattedValue shows count + relative time
- Null safety: locations ?? [], visitCount ?? 0, addressName ?? '—', lastVisited checked before formatRelative
- No unit conversions needed (visit counts are unit-less; miles_to_arrival not shown in widget spec)
- All strings via useTranslation('dashboard')
- Freshness props merged from both hooks (max updatedAt, OR'd booleans)

